#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "1. Initialize the account {#1-initialize-the-account}"
msgstr "1. Initialiser le compte {#1-initialize-the-account}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Because Qiskit Runtime is a managed service, you first need to initialize "
"your account. You can then select the QPU you want to use to calculate the "
"expectation value.\n"
msgstr ""
"Comme Qiskit Runtime est un service géré, tu dois d'abord initialiser ton "
"compte. Tu peux ensuite sélectionner la QPU que tu veux utiliser pour "
"calculer la valeur d'espérance.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Follow the steps in the [Set up your IBM Cloud account](/guides/cloud-setup)"
" topic if you don't already have an account set up.\n"
msgstr ""
"Suis les étapes de la rubrique [Configurer ton compte IBM "
"Cloud](/guides/cloud-setup) si tu n'as pas encore configuré de compte.\n"

